{"id": "1702391", "name": "השפעת שינוי סדר איברי בסיסים על מטריצה מעבר 3X3", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "permute_columns", "params": ["A", "perm"], "body": "block(B:transpose(A), cols: map(lambda([i], B[i]), perm), transpose(apply(matrix,cols)))"}, {"name": "apply_permutation", "params": ["l", "perm"], "body": "map(lambda([i], l[i]), perm)"}, {"name": "invert_permutation", "params": ["perm"], "body": "block([n: length(perm)], inv_perm: makelist(0, i,1,n), for i:1 thru n do (inv_perm[perm[i]]:i), inv_perm)"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>יהא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(V\\)</span> מרחב וקטורי. יהיו</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[B={{CT:0}}, \\quad C={{CT:1}}\\]</p><p>שני בסיסים ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(V\\)</span>. נתון כי מטריצת המעבר בין הבסיסים היא:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[[I]^B_C = {{CT:2}}\\]</p><p>נסתכל בשינוי סדר איברי הבסיסים ונגדיר בסיסים חדשים:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[B'={{CT:3}},\\quad C'={{CT:4}}\\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>מצאו את מטריצת המעבר בין הבסיסים החדשים:</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\([I]^{B'}_{C'} = \\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p class=\"input-hint input-hint-grid\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"font-size:0.88em;color:#555;margin:6px 0 0;text-align:right\">איך מזינים: כל איבר בתיבה משלו: מספר, שבר (למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">1/2</code>) או ביטוי (למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">sqrt(2)</code>).</p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "matrix", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "ta", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["B", "M", "cols", "idxs", "inv_perm", "matrixEntry", "n", "new_idxsB", "new_idxsC", "ta", "varsB", "varsBtag", "varsC", "varsCtag"], "nvariants": 50}